WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:06.155
Okay, so a quick start guide gets one reader to one working result by the shortest supported path.

2
00:00:06.155 --> 00:00:09.680
So I list each tool's minimum version first,

3
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.693
because an old version breaks step one with nothing pointing at the cause.

4
00:00:13.693 --> 00:00:17.233
Then each command gets its exact output beside it,

5
00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:21.222
so the reader can tell within one step whether they're on track.

6
00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:23.027
In my GitHub example,

7
00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:25.142
curl needs fail-with-body,

8
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:28.787
because without it a four-oh-four still exits zero,

9
00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:30.583
and jq prints null.

10
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.373
And before I publish,

11
00:00:32.578 --> 00:00:37.453
I run every command in a fresh directory and compare its output with the page.
